# Harnesses you save yourself land here.
#
# Use "Save Harness as Preset…" — on a Harness component's right-click menu, or on the "Harness"
# widget at the top-left of the canvas while you are inside one. Anything here shows up in the chat
# window's "Add preset" gallery under "User".
#
# You can also drop a .gh in by hand: a preset is an ordinary Grasshopper file holding one harness's
# worth of pipeline, and it must contain a Chat component or it cannot be loaded back.
#
# This file only exists to keep the folder in git. It is ignored by the gallery, which lists .gh only.
